* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_ed (reference/crafted.toml, 19 Nov 2026): elastic demand (%TIMESED% YES; M1.3
* change 69), the variant run of a two-run case (#165 d3). The base prices come from the base run
* demo12_edbase (demo12 with %TIMESED% NO; com_bprice.gdx of its CPLEX solve, copied into GAMS's work folder by the
* harness, `work_files`). Added to demo12:
* - elastic car and space-heating demands (DTCAR, DRSH) in both regions: COM_ELAST, COM_STEP, COM_VOC, both
*   directions;
* - a shaped elasticity (COM_ELASTX 2, SHAPE row 2) for REG1's DRSH downwards (ppmain.mod L625, coef_obj.mod
*   L184-189, eqobjels.mod L16-19);
* - the additional constraint: a tax on REG1's transport and residential CO2 from 2020, which moves demand from its
*   base level.
